.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::NumIntegral_NT_op_N_dS\fP< dim >::ComputeContribution (const \fBFace\fP< dim > & e)\fR [final]\fP, \fR [override]\fP, \fR [virtual]\fP"
Computes the volume integral over the element interpolation functions times the \fBOperand\fP\&. If the \fBOperand\fP is 1 over the element, then the volume integral is naturally 1 as well\&. 
.br

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
accumulation takes place only for faces where the Material \fBOperand\fP is flagged Neumann\&. 
.RE
.PP

